    "2026-09-11: compared predictions for 890 ENDED sessions since 2026-08-29 and reviewed 99 regression cases; retain unknown for insufficient evidence",
    "hololive Dreams is a rhythm/RPG game (https://www.hololive-dreams.com/); gameplay is game, while explicit tournament/event lead tags retain their priority",
    "ark/rust/peak are tag_only because the bare English words can describe non-game subjects",
    "振り返り配信 identifies a dedicated retrospective even when its source topic names the game being discussed",
    "2026-09-11 round 2: public metadata reviewed for all 40 remaining unknown broadcasts; exact video/channel-bound reviews supplement title/topic evidence. Reviewer evidence is versioned here, never inferred from a generic greeting or all channel profile keywords."
